  "notable_quotes": [
    "In a 4-step VSA with light-product pressurization, CALF-20 achieved 95% CO2 purity and 90% recovery from dry 15/85 CO2/N2 flue gas.",
    "Under these VSA conditions, CALF-20 performance was comparable to benchmark adsorbents zeolite 13X and UTSA-16.",
    "A one-dimensional column model reproduced both composition and temperature histories with good agreement to breakthrough experiments."
